<div class="container">
    <h1>魔鬼的挑战级数</h1>
    <p>接下来几页的魔鬼速览：</p>

    <div class="two-col-layout">
        <!-- 左栏 -->
        <div class="col">
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR1</span><span class="cr-name">劣魔</span>成群攻击，无心智的受苦生物。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR2</span><span class="cr-name">小魔鬼</span>以暗黑建议与诡计协助邪恶凡人的聪明生物。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR5</span><span class="cr-name">骨魔</span>巴霸魔。以锯齿大砍刀狂乱攻击的凶猛战士。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR6</span><span class="cr-name">炼魔</span>坎协魔。嗜杀折磨成性，挥舞着炼狱锁链发号施令。</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 右栏 -->
        <div class="col">
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR7</span><span class="cr-name">地狱猫</span>彼吉拉魔。似猫的隐形地狱魔鬼，与虎差不多大。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR8</span><span class="cr-name">欲魔</span>以炽焰弓条生送亡的堕落天使。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR9</span><span class="cr-name">骨魔</span>奥塞魔。拥有危险螫刺，心怀憎恨的魔族。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR11</span><span class="cr-name">棘魔</span>哈玛魔。炼狱精英战士，拥有尖刺。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR13</span><span class="cr-name">冰魔</span>奇鲁魔。拥有致死寒冷攻击的似虫恐怖生物。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR16</span><span class="cr-name">角魔</span>恐纳魔。装备刺链，似石像鬼的魔族。</div>
            <div class="cr-item"><span class="cr-label">CR20</span><span class="cr-name">深狱炼魔</span>魔鬼之王，拥有致命的强大力量。</div>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
